// Declarations the vendored 5.0.16 header set is missing.
//
// tools/galaxy/headers/ is a snapshot of the Editor's own headers and has
// known gaps (LESSONS.md: "static Galaxy checking with older cached headers
// has known gaps"). Anything this project calls that the snapshot does not
// declare is written out here, with the evidence that it is real, so
// galaxy_check.py does not have to be told to ignore it.

// Called by every Editor-generated MapScript.galaxy as the first statement of
// InitMap; see the generated scripts of any map built by 5.0.16.
void libNtve_InitLib ();
